The first 3.4.2 ascension post!

The new projectile behaviour works wonders for Tourists. The initial 
bunch of +2 darts lasts for ages.
I found +3 speed boots in a level 2 armor shop, which was a very good 
start. I relied mostly on darts while I built my strength up. Sokoban 
had the amulet. By the time my initial darts had run out, I found a 
luckstone, maxed out my luck and enchanted up another bunch (about 
forty) of darts. The Lady at some point gave me Mjollnir, which I 
stuffed into a bag.

Couldn't find a bag of holding anywhere: eventually got a wish from a 
fountain to get one. I consorted with succubi about twenty times, and 
didn't get a single level. :-( I completed the quest with blessed 
poisoned +3 (or maybe +4) darts. I reached the Castle, wished for GoP 
and some magic markers. Charged up a ring of increase damage to +6. 25 
Str + expert darts + 6 damage bonus = lots of damage. Grimtooth was in 
the Castle's weapon room.

Went through Gehennom, using scrolls of magic mapping. Asmo wasn't 
impressed when I offered him 666 zorkmids for safe passage (he wanted 
693). Gave Baal two bits for an ale, and he left me alone. Got another 
wish from Vlad's throne, got another magic marker. (I really must try 
another wishless ascension one day.)

I managed to stuff up my weaponless conduct when I forgot to quiver my 
darts after enchanting them up to +6. (#%$@&!)

Performed the invocation, worked my way through the Sanctum, got the 
Amulet, went back out again. This must be a record for the least 
pervasive mysterious force ever: only knocked back three (3) times, 
twice down one level, once put me elesewhere on the level.

Rodney put in a cameo on the way up. On the Earth plane, the portal was 
just to the north of the start: I stumbled in still confused from the 
?oGD trick, so I got two portals for the price of one confusion. 
Unfortunately I ran out of confusion methods on Water, so had to wander 
around a bit. Rodney showed once more and got death rayed.

Went to the left-hand door on Astral, guarded by Death. He went down to 
three darts. Snuck past the priests and Angels, found the neutral altar, 
sacced the Amulet.

